luci-theme-edge21 - "Edge (21.02 port)"

Stylesheet from luci-theme-edge by Kiddin' (kiddin9) and GaryPang,
https://github.com/kiddin9/luci-theme-edge. The repository has no LICENSE file; its
Makefile (PKG_LICENSE:=Apache-2.0) and file headers state the Apache License 2.0.
Edge derives from luci-theme-argon by jerrykuku and luci-theme-material by Lutty Yang
(both Apache-2.0); its header credits the Argon Dashboard design by Creative Tim.
Layout, templates, menu script, icon font and jQuery copy from luci-theme-argon 2.3.1
by jerrykuku, https://github.com/jerrykuku/luci-theme-argon (Apache-2.0).

Port changes (2026, Dror Dvash): Edge's stylesheet put on the Argon 2.3.1 templates
(Edge's own templates not used: they fetched Unsplash photos with curl on the router
and played remote login audio); the embedded Google Sans font removed (not
redistributable; system fonts instead); login photos, script.js, waves.css and logo
image removed; a dark palette of the port's own (Edge is light only upstream) with
a light/dark button, following the browser until one is picked; Edge's login look
(frosted card over a landscape) rebuilt with a landscape drawn by the port in SVG/CSS
(no photos, audio or downloads), with a night variant; reduced-motion
support, 21.02 widget fixes, phone fix for
"-- custom --" dropdown entries.
